      "v": 2,
      "zh": "原来我们在许多事上都有过失；若有人在话语上没有过失，他就是完全人，也能勒住自己的全身。",
      "en": "For we all stumble[NOTE:1] in many ways. If someone does not stumble[NOTE:2] in what he says,[NOTE:3] he is a perfect individual,[NOTE:4] able to control the entire body as well.",
